set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A324242

Incomplete Lucas numbers: irregular triangular array L(n,k) = Sum_{j = 0..k} (n/(n-j)) * binomial(n-j, j), read by rows, with n >= 1 and 0 <= k <= floor(n/2).

The 71 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A324242

